e. preparation of materials for evaluation of organizational performance;
f. preparation of materials for organizational development; and
g. implementation of other duties assigned by the Head of General Section in accordance with their duties and functions.

7. The provisions of Article 8 are amended so that Article 8 reads as follows:

Article 8

(1) Public Relations and Protocol Sub-Section as referred to in Article 3 paragraph (2) letter c has the duty to carry out public relations and protocol affairs.

(2) To carry out the duties as referred to in paragraph (1), Public Relations and Protocol Sub-Section performs the following functions:
