e. preparation of materials for ceremonial affairs;
f. preparation of materials for reception of official guests; and
g. implementation of other duties assigned by the Head of General Section in accordance with their duties and functions.

8. Between Article 8 and Article 9, 1 (one) article is inserted, namely Article 8A so that it reads as follows:

Article 8A

(1) General Affairs Sub-Section as referred to in Article 3 paragraph (2) letter d has the duty to carry out general affairs.

(2) To carry out the duties as referred to in paragraph (1), General Affairs Sub-Section performs the following functions:
