10. The provisions of Article 10 are amended so that Article 10 reads as follows:

Article 10

(1) Administration Sub-Section as referred to in Article 3 paragraph (3) letter a has the duty to carry out administration affairs.

(2) To carry out the duties as referred to in paragraph (1), Administration Sub-Section performs the following functions:
