f. preparation of materials for coordination of village financial management; and
g. implementation of other duties assigned by the Head of Government Section in accordance with their duties and functions.

12. The provisions of Article 12 are amended so that Article 12 reads as follows:

Article 12

(1) Welfare Section as referred to in Article 3 paragraph (1) letter d has the duty to carry out coordination of people's welfare affairs and social assistance.

(2) To carry out the duties as referred to in paragraph (1), Welfare Section performs the following functions:
a. coordination of people's welfare affairs;
b. coordination of social assistance affairs; and
c. implementation of other duties assigned by the Regional Secretary in accordance with their duties and functions.

13. The provisions of Article 13 are amended so that Article 13 reads as follows:

Article 13

(1) People's Welfare Sub-Section as referred to in Article 3 paragraph (4) letter a has the duty to carry out people's welfare affairs.

(2) To carry out the duties as referred to in paragraph (1), People's Welfare Sub-Section performs the following functions:
